  <ac:rich-text-body>
    <p>Optics Library is NOT yet compatible with the new motion library upgrade and its updated public surface. Do not upgrade to the new motion library in environments that depend on Optics for now; doing so may break builds or runtime behavior until alignment is complete.</p>
